# VibProject template repository policy
#
# This repository intentionally tracks the template project/ structure,
# governance files, and placeholders. Do NOT add an active /project/ ignore
# rule to the template repository itself.
#
# For a fresh project copied from this template, run setup-project.ps1 before
# manual Git initialization. The initializer adds a fresh-project-only rule so
# content under project/ remains private/local in that new project.
#
# .gitignore never untracks files that Git already tracks.
